{
  "requirement": "If a process outside the application occupies the preferred local port, the dialog MUST offer the suggested free port and a user-specified alternative. It MUST initially select the suggested free port, MUST NOT offer to replace the other process, and MUST NOT stop it.\n\n```text\n(x) Use suggested alternative local port 8031\n( ) Use alternative local port [       ]\n```",
  "determination": true,
  "rationale": "Checked that unmanaged conflicts offer only suggested and manual choices, default to suggested, and leave the occupying process untouched. The test passed.",
